  "id": "45944c7c3f4c75beaa87f36138b2bba9fb9198a3",
  "message": "fix(kiem-dong-wp): D2b — cam dau cheo nguoc tren duong dan dich va doi dich tho chuan tac (C05; wp1236 dot C, luot 6)\n\nTra loi review ma luot 5/6 tren 8aab9da (changes_requested: C05 P2) theo quyet dinh cua chu kho\no #1236 issuecomment-7182681531, bo sung cho luat danh sach cho phep (issuecomment-7180063460).\n\nMot symlink (120000) trong thu muc provenance nay chi qua khi ca ba dieu sau dung:\n(a) join(dirname(link), readlink), TRUOC khi chuan hoa, khong mang dau cheo nguoc: ca dich tho lan\n    thu muc chua link. Luot 5 chi so tung byte voi danh muc, nen tren POSIX mot tep mang dung ten\n    co dau cheo nguoc lam link tro toi no lot voi rc 0 (reviewer do native tren 3.13.18 va 3.12.3);\n(b) dich tho da o dang chuan tac: posixpath.normpath(d) == d. Bo bung cua Python truoc 3.12.11 /\n    3.13.4 giu nguyen van ban dich, nen `a/../x` voi `a` vang (dich hong) tung chuan hoa ra dung\n    mot tep thuong va lot. He qua co chu dich: `./x`, `a//b`, `sub/../x` cung bi chan;\n(c) duong dan dich sau chuan hoa trung tung byte mot tep thuong cua danh muc (nhu luot 5).\nCon lai tra kiem_tep:not_measured:symlink (rc 12) ma khong goi module.\n\nTest: bang _D2B_TB (chi POSIX: Git for Windows khong nhan duong dan index mang dau cheo nguoc) co\nnam thu muc ma cay CO THAT ten mang dau cheo nguoc (tep 100644, 100755, thanh phan thu muc, link\nlong, link nam trong thu muc ay); thu muc lkl va mo hinh git_loi=\"nguyen\" (bo bung giu nguyen van\nban dich) cho dich hong khong chuan tac. Dot bien moi: bo_cam_cheo, cam_cheo_chi_dich_tho,\nbo_chuan_tac; cho_ten_lka bo vi dieu cam rieng da chan lka.\n\nChua do: Windows voi Python >= 3.12.11 / 3.13.4 (data_filter dung ntpath.normpath, doi `/` trong\ndich thanh dau cheo nguoc => cac bien the lk6, lk7, lkc se ra rc 8 thay vi rc 12).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrZsYAFm7iLa11eWogL",
  "timestamp": "2026-11-26T04:59:32Z",
  "tree_id": "66a0f315c1cf27eaac67beae06ee20cd1789f23a"
 },
